### Orvexa API v1 — journey step 14: conversation search (read model)
### Full-text search over the event-sourced OpenSearch projection
### (orvexa-conversations index). Eventually consistent with PostgreSQL.
###
### Degradation principle — a search outage never blocks the hot path:
###   - backend unset    → 503 {error:{code:"search.not_configured"}}
###   - backend down/slow → 503 {error:{code:"search.unavailable"}}
###
### The tenant filter is applied SERVER-SIDE from the authenticated API key —
### there is no tenant parameter, a client cannot express cross-tenant search.

@ORVEXA_URL = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_URL}}
@ORVEXA_KEY = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_KEY}}

### Search → 200 {total, limit, hits[]} or typed 503 degradation
# q: simple query string over projected search text, customer and channel
#    (1–256 chars → else 422); limit server-capped at 50 (default 25)
# @name searchConversations
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/search/conversations?q=help&limit=25
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
